@host = https://localhost:7037
@access = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refresh = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Login → access + refresh
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@todo.com",
    "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 2. GET tasks WITH access token → 200
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 3. Refresh → новая пара
# @name refreshCall
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

### 4. Использовать СТАРЫЙ refresh ещё раз → 401 (ротация сработала)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

### 5. Logout конкретного refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

### 6. Logout-all → отозвать ВСЕ refresh пользователя
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 7. Истёкший access → 401
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.ExpiredTokenExample